SUMMARY:Working Smarter with {dplyr} 1.2.0 - R-Ladies Abuja
DESCRIPTION:Discover how the latest features in **{dplyr} 1.2.0** can help you write cleaner, faster, and more maintainable data transformation workflows. This session explores practical techniques for filtering, joining, summarizing, and reshaping data more efficiently, with real-world examples that demonstrate how to streamline your R code and improve productivity.
